00:53:33.000 --> 00:54:23.000
Ivalice Berrios Begaris's killer was over Chandler. At the time of Ivalice's murder, Chandler lived less than two miles from the mall where she worked. Chandler abruptly moved away days after the slain. He was in such a haste he left all his furniture behind. One of the detectives fronting Ivalice's cold case told CBS News, It was a case that people were very afraid of and now finding out years later who the suspect was. They had every right to be afraid. By the time over Chandler was identified as Ivalice's killer, he had been dead for three years.
